WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.056
Hi, my name is Ebony and I'm the founder
of Master Blueprint which is an early

00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:07.000
childhood compliance platform.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
When I came to Andy, I had a clear vision
of where I wanted to go.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I wanted to build an MVP to validate my
problem and hopefully seek investment.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.860
I picked Andy and the team at All Webbed
Up because they genuinely wanted to help

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.000
me with my project.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.727
They treated my project like it was their
own, they were just as invested in it as I

00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:32.000
was.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.909
Coming from a non-tech background, Andy
and his team have got above and beyond to

00:00:36.909 --> 00:00:38.000
word conversations

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.857
in ways that I can understand. They gave
advice beyond software, giving me a sense

00:00:43.857 --> 00:00:47.000
of direction and the realistic
possibilities

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
to actually make this project real.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Andy and his team have gone above and
beyond.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.326
They have conducted meetings phone calls
with me after hours, are aware of my

00:00:58.326 --> 00:00:59.000
schedule and

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.000
flexibilities.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
They are very detailed in their responses.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.694
They don't cut to the chase and sometimes
they tell you things that you don't want

00:01:05.694 --> 00:01:07.000
to hear but you need to hear.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.765
And that's the transparency and honesty
that is going to set people like me up to

00:01:11.765 --> 00:01:12.000
have

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.000
successful businesses.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.655
Anything in this team All Webbed Up have
gone over the top to help me succeed and

00:01:17.655 --> 00:01:18.000
that's

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.000
why I think it was worth it.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.000
They're worth it.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
I could not have imagined the difference
my experience and my functioning

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.851
product would have been if I had chosen
someone else, another team, to do my

00:01:30.851 --> 00:01:32.000
project. If you're

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.714
unsure about taking the plunge, I just
would say go for it. I was the exact same

00:01:37.714 --> 00:01:39.000
and it all started

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:44.091
with a conversation with Andy. Now I've
achieved so much and I honestly am so

00:01:44.091 --> 00:01:47.000
thankful and I'm so happy that I've
actually

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.611
gone ahead and started this journey and I
cannot wait what the future has installed

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:52.000
for me.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.171
My project and Andy and the team's
collaboration with me.
